{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador", "label": "ADR-013 \u2014 Modelo do MPC: matriz SOPDT + integrador; horizontes derivados do TSS", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_sopdt_modelo", "label": "Matriz de modelos SOPDT/integrador com horizontes derivados do TSS", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Detalha o ADR-008: matriz por par MV\u2192CV e DV\u2192CV; CV autorregul\u00e1vel usa SOPDT (K, \u03c41, \u03c42, \u03b8), CV integradora usa Ki + \u03b8. Np/Nc n\u00e3o s\u00e3o editados: derivados do TSS por CV (Ts_mpc = multiplicador \u00d7 Ts_flow; Np = ceil(TSS/Ts_mpc); Nc = max(2, ceil(Np/4))) \u2014 TSS \u00e9 n\u00famero que engenheiro sabe estimar, eliminando horizontes errados como modo de falha. Tempo morto via aumento de estados; integrador sem restri\u00e7\u00e3o de CV \u00e9 malha aberta inst\u00e1vel \u2192 valida\u00e7\u00e3o exige limites/SP coerentes."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador", "target": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador_sopdt_modelo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/ottimasystem-docsv1.1/adr/ADR-013-modelo-sopdt-tss-integrador.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_013_modelo_sopdt_tss_integrador", "target": "docs_ottimasystem_docsv1_1_adr_adr_008_mpc_config_formulario_abas", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score":